flowchart TD
 A[Approved institution rulebook] --> B[Authorized agenda and sourced proposal]
 B --> C[Deliberation and amendment]
 C --> D[Text version frozen]
 D --> E{Eligibility quorum and procedure valid?}
 E -->|No or unknown| X[Stop or advisory only]
 E -->|Yes| F[Authorized ballots]
 F --> G[Independent tally and rule check]
 G --> H{Verified and challenges resolved?}
 H -->|No| X
 H -->|Yes| I[Certify institution decision]
 I --> J{Effect-time legal authority valid?}
 J -->|No| X
 J -->|Yes| K[Record effect and Proof Passport]
